Scope of this license:

This LICENSE file covers all original source files in this
`pre-silicon-mlkem-tvla/` artefact folder, including:

  scripts/L1/*.py        — L1 RTL-level Welch-t validation and fan-in audit
  scripts/L35/*.py       — L3.5 per-tile / per-PIP analysis
  scripts/silicon/*.py   — silicon CCA-PC TVLA validation
  src/tsim_kernel/tsim.h — tensor-encoded RTL simulator kernel
  src/oim/*.py           — OIM (Operation-Indexed-Model) C-header generator
  src/rtl/masking_cone_top*.sv — synthetic wrappers for the masking sub-cone
  README.md, VALIDATION_LOG.md, TABLE_*.md, BITSTREAM_PROVENANCE.md
  TOOLCHAIN_PIN.txt

Files copied without modification from upstream tools (Yosys, nextpnr-xilinx,
prjxray, ChipWhisperer, FIPS-203/204 reference) retain their upstream
licenses; see TOOLCHAIN_PIN.txt for the upstream URLs and license terms.

The PQC RTL under `src/rtl/ise/` is licensed under the same terms as the
parent project (see ../LICENSE if present).
